            "sid": "EZK 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu yidilili atulamba twawaIsarela mukeŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neyi, Mama yeyi wadipi ŋahi? Wadipi mukaji wamutupa, wawutaminaŋa mukachi kawakwawu anyituŋa, hakulela anyanindi mukachi kanyenzi yanyituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakukulisha mwanindi wumu; hakwikala mwenzi wamutupa; hakudiza kukwata, hakudya antu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuza hiyikutiya nsaŋu yindi; hiyakumukwata muwina wawu. Hiyakumutwala mwituŋa daEjipitu namalonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukaji wamutupa chanamoniyi neli dehi talile-e, nimwakuhwelelaŋayi munakumi dehi, hakunona mwanindi mukwawu, hakumukulisha ekali mwenzi wamutupa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwendaŋana mukachi kawanyituŋa, hakwikala mwenzi wamutupa; hakudiza kukwata, hakudya antu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welukili kumatalawu awanta, hakujilisha nyikala yawu to-o, ituŋa dadipi denzala yuma dibalumuka nimahembi nakubuluma kwabuluminaŋayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumukumaŋena mbadi jejima kudi nyuza yinafumi kumawulopu, hiyakumunatila wanda wawu hewulu, hiyakumukwata muwina wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumusha muchiŋala namalonda, hiyakumutwala kudi mwanta wakuBabiloni. Hiyakumutwala muyiŋaka yakuhatisha, kulonda izu dindi dibuli kutiyakana cheŋi hampidi jamuIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
